values ('brand-positioning', 'Brand Positioning', 'Brand & Identity', 'The single space you own in a buyer’s mind — defended with evidence, not adjectives.', 'Most companies are positioned by accident: by whoever spoke loudest in the last workshop. We find the position that is both true and unoccupied, then make it defensible — so the market files you under a category of one.', ARRAY['Category and frame-of-reference definition', 'Point-of-difference and proof', 'Positioning statement and messaging house', 'Migration plan from where you are today']::text[], 'What do we want to be the obvious choice for?', 'A position competitors cannot copy without becoming you.', ARRAY['brand positioning', 'how to reposition a company', 'positioning statement examples', 'category of one strategy']::text[], 1, true)
