values ('naming', 'Naming', 'Brand & Identity', 'Names for companies, products and ranges — decided, not voted on.', 'A name is a bet on a set of values that do not yet exist in the market. We do not hand over a list of four hundred and ask you to choose. We make a decision, defend it linguistically and legally, and give you the story that makes it stick.', ARRAY['Naming strategy and territories', 'Creation and shortlisting', 'Linguistic and trademark screening', 'Rationale and rollout language']::text[], 'What should this be called, and can we own it?', 'A name you can register, defend and grow into.', ARRAY['brand naming agency', 'how to name a company', 'product naming process', 'is my brand name available']::text[], 2, true)
