values ('brand-identity', 'Visual Identity', 'Brand & Identity', 'A complete visual system — logo, type, colour, layout — that survives without the logo.', 'Recognition does not come from a logo. It comes from a set of codes so consistent that the brand is legible even when the name is missing. We build that system and the guidelines that keep it alive.', ARRAY['Logo, symbol and lockups', 'Type, colour and layout systems', 'Art direction and iconography', 'Brand guidelines and asset libraries']::text[], 'What makes us unmistakable at a glance?', 'A system your team can run without us in the room.', ARRAY['visual identity design', 'brand identity system', 'logo and brand guidelines', 'rebrand agency']::text[], 4, true)
