values ('verbal-identity', 'Verbal Identity', 'Brand & Identity', 'The words that only your company would use — tone, vocabulary and the rules that keep them consistent.', 'A visual system tells you what a brand looks like. A verbal identity tells you what it sounds like — the vocabulary it reaches for, the jokes it does and does not make, the sentence length that feels like it. We write the rules, then write the first hundred examples so the team can hear the difference.', ARRAY['Tone of voice principles', 'Vocabulary and lexicon', 'Messaging house and headline library', 'Copy guidelines and training']::text[], 'Would someone recognise our writing with the logo removed?', 'A voice specific enough to be worth protecting.', ARRAY['brand tone of voice', 'verbal identity guidelines', 'brand messaging framework', 'how to write brand voice guidelines']::text[], 5, true)
