values ('web-design-development', 'Website Design & Development', 'Digital & Product', 'Websites that load fast, read clearly to search and AI crawlers, and move people towards a decision.', 'A website is where most people decide whether to trust you. We design and build sites that load fast, read well to search engines and AI crawlers, and move visitors towards a decision — without ever looking like a template.', ARRAY['Design and art direction', 'Front-end build and CMS', 'Core Web Vitals and performance', 'Schema, semantics and accessibility']::text[], 'Does our website earn trust and enquiries?', 'A site that ranks, converts and is easy to keep alive.', ARRAY['website design agency', 'high converting website design', 'SEO friendly web design', 'CMS website build']::text[], 8, true)
