values ('digital-product-design', 'Digital Product Design', 'Digital & Product', 'Apps, platforms and tools designed and engineered end to end.', 'Some brands need more than a website — they need a product. We take digital products from concept to shipped, joining design and engineering so the thing you launch is the thing you argued for.', ARRAY['Product strategy and scoping', 'Design and prototyping', 'Full-stack engineering', 'Iteration and roadmap']::text[], 'What should we build, and can you build it?', 'A product in market, not a prototype in a drawer.', ARRAY['digital product design agency', 'app design and development', 'MVP build', 'product engineering studio']::text[], 10, true)
