values ('ecommerce', 'E-commerce', 'Digital & Product', 'Storefronts and checkout experiences built to convert, not just to display a catalogue.', 'An e-commerce site is a sales floor with the lighting, the queue and the assistant all designed at once. We build storefronts, product pages and checkout flows tuned for conversion and repeat purchase, on the platform that actually suits the business.', ARRAY['Platform selection and build', 'Product and category page design', 'Checkout and conversion optimisation', 'Merchandising and CRO testing']::text[], 'Is the path from interest to purchase as short as it should be?', 'A storefront that turns browsing into buying.', ARRAY['ecommerce website design', 'Shopify agency', 'conversion rate optimisation ecommerce', 'ecommerce UX design']::text[], 11, true)
