values ('seo', 'SEO', 'Growth & Demand', 'Technical, content and entity SEO built for Google and AI answer engines.', 'Search in 2026 is two games at once: ranking in Google and being the source an AI answer quotes. We do both — technical foundations, semantic content and entity authority — so you show up where the decision is actually being made.', ARRAY['Technical SEO and Core Web Vitals', 'Entity and topical authority', 'On-page and content optimisation', 'AI-search and answer-engine optimisation']::text[], 'Do we show up when it matters, in search and in AI answers?', 'Qualified traffic that arrives ready to enquire.', ARRAY['SEO agency 2026', 'AI search optimisation', 'answer engine optimisation', 'entity SEO', 'how to rank in ChatGPT and Perplexity']::text[], 14, true)
