values ('content-strategy', 'Content Strategy & Content Management', 'Growth & Demand', 'What to say, where and why — plus the operating system that keeps it published on time.', 'Content is how a brand earns attention between purchases. We define the themes you can credibly own, the formats that suit each channel, the semantic structure that gets you cited by search and AI, and the calendar and workflow that make it sustainable rather than sporadic.', ARRAY['Editorial strategy and pillars', 'Topic and entity mapping for SEO', 'Content operations and calendar', 'Measurement and iteration']::text[], 'What should we publish, and can we actually keep it up?', 'A content engine that compounds instead of resets.', ARRAY['content strategy agency', 'SEO content strategy', 'editorial strategy for brands', 'content management for AI search']::text[], 15, true)
