values ('social-media', 'Social Media Strategy & Management', 'Growth & Demand', 'A social presence with a point of view, run with the discipline of a publication.', 'Most brand social is a content calendar wearing a strategy costume. We start with what the brand actually has to say, choose the platforms worth the effort, and run the account like an editor would — consistent voice, considered pace, real engagement.', ARRAY['Platform and format strategy', 'Content planning and production', 'Community management', 'Analytics and iteration']::text[], 'Does our social output sound like anyone in particular?', 'A following that behaves like an audience, not a number.', ARRAY['social media strategy agency', 'social media management agency', 'brand social media strategy', 'organic social growth']::text[], 16, true)
