values ('influencer-marketing', 'Influencer / Creator Marketing', 'Growth & Demand', 'Creator partnerships chosen for fit and trust, not follower counts.', 'The best creator partnerships feel like a recommendation, not an advert. We find the voices your audience already trusts, brief them properly, and build relationships that pay back beyond a single post.', ARRAY['Creator strategy and sourcing', 'Briefing and relationship management', 'Content rights and usage', 'Performance and measurement']::text[], 'Who does our audience believe, and how do we work with them well?', 'Partnerships that read as trust, not spend.', ARRAY['influencer marketing agency', 'creator partnerships', 'UGC strategy', 'how to run influencer campaigns']::text[], 17, true)
