values ('email-marketing', 'Email Marketing', 'Growth & Demand', 'Lifecycle and CRM programmes that turn a list into revenue.', 'Email is the one channel you own. We design lifecycle programmes — welcome, nurture, retention, win-back — that sound like your brand and move numbers you can see in the dashboard by Friday.', ARRAY['Lifecycle and automation design', 'Segmentation and CRM strategy', 'Copy, design and templates', 'Testing and deliverability']::text[], 'Is our owned audience actually earning?', 'Revenue from people who already know you.', ARRAY['email marketing agency', 'CRM lifecycle marketing', 'klaviyo agency', 'retention marketing']::text[], 18, true)
