values ('campaign-strategy', 'Campaign Strategy', 'Growth & Demand', 'The big idea and the media plan that gets it in front of the right people, on time.', 'A campaign is not a creative treatment looking for a channel plan. It is one idea, expressed correctly for each place it appears, with a media plan built around when and how your audience actually pays attention. We design both halves together.', ARRAY['Campaign idea and concept', 'Channel and media planning', 'Cross-format asset development', 'Flighting and measurement']::text[], 'What is the one idea, and where does it need to show up?', 'A campaign that feels planned, not scattered.', ARRAY['campaign strategy agency', 'integrated campaign planning', 'creative campaign development', 'media planning for brand campaigns']::text[], 19, true)
