values ('market-research', 'Market Research', 'Market & Expansion', 'Evidence about buyers, categories and pricing — before the expensive decisions.', 'We research to decide, not to reassure. Qualitative depth where nuance matters, quantitative scale where confidence does, and a synthesis that actually changes what you build next.', ARRAY['Qualitative interviews and ethnography', 'Quantitative surveys and segmentation', 'Pricing and willingness-to-pay studies', 'Category and trend analysis']::text[], 'What do our buyers actually believe, and pay for?', 'Decisions grounded in evidence instead of the loudest opinion.', ARRAY['brand market research', 'customer segmentation study', 'pricing research', 'willingness to pay analysis']::text[], 20, true)
