values ('b2b-partnerships', 'B2B Partnerships & Potential Client Meetings', 'Market & Expansion', 'Distribution through other companies — targeting, outreach and the meetings themselves.', 'Sometimes the fastest route to demand is someone else’s audience. We design and broker partnerships — co-marketing, channel, bundling — and, where useful, get in the room ourselves: identifying, approaching and meeting the businesses worth partnering with.', ARRAY['Partnership strategy and targeting', 'Outreach and deal shaping', 'Co-marketing programmes', 'Meeting preparation and facilitation']::text[], 'Whose audience should we borrow, and on what terms?', 'A distribution channel that is not more ad spend.', ARRAY['B2B partnership strategy', 'co-marketing agency', 'channel partnerships', 'strategic alliances']::text[], 22, true)
