values ('market-entry', 'Market Entry', 'Market & Expansion', 'The research, positioning and plan for taking a brand into a new country or category.', 'A brand that works in one market does not automatically work in the next one. We assess demand, competition, regulation and cultural fit before recommending how — or whether — to enter, then build the localised positioning and plan to do it properly.', ARRAY['Market viability assessment', 'Competitive and regulatory landscape', 'Localised positioning and messaging', 'Entry sequencing and partners']::text[], 'Should we enter this market, and if so, how?', 'A market-entry plan grounded in evidence, not enthusiasm.', ARRAY['international market entry strategy', 'market expansion strategy', 'how to launch a brand in a new country', 'market entry consultancy']::text[], 23, true)
