values ('growth-process-consultancy', 'Growth Process Consultancy', 'Market & Expansion', 'How the team actually plans, ships and measures growth work — not just what it should do next.', 'Sometimes the plan is right and the process around it is broken: nobody owns the roadmap, testing has no rhythm, and every quarter starts from a blank page. We audit how growth actually gets decided and shipped inside your company, then install a process your team keeps using after we leave.', ARRAY['Growth operating rhythm audit', 'Roadmap, ownership and reporting structure', 'Testing and prioritisation frameworks', 'Team training and handover']::text[], 'Is the bottleneck the strategy, or how we work?', 'A growth process the team runs without us.', ARRAY['growth process consulting', 'marketing operations consultancy', 'growth team operating model', 'how to build a growth roadmap']::text[], 25, true)
