values ('events', 'Events', 'Experiences', 'Gatherings designed to build the brand in the room, not just fill a calendar.', 'Some brand-building only happens in person. We concept, design and produce events worth attending — launches, dinners, studio evenings — treating the room itself as a piece of creative work with a beginning, middle and end.', ARRAY['Event concept and identity', 'Guest experience design', 'Production and on-the-day delivery', 'Follow-up and measurement']::text[], 'What is worth gathering people for, and will they remember it?', 'A room that remembers you.', ARRAY['brand events agency', 'experiential marketing agency', 'launch event production', 'corporate event design']::text[], 26, true)
